SUMMARY:Clean Monday panigiri\, Nenita
LOCATION:Nenita\, Chios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The mastic village of Nenita in the south ends carnival with a traditional Clean Monday panigiri in the village square\, organised by the 'Vokaria' cultural association with a live folk orchestra\, Lenten food and dancing. Nenita also holds a summer panigiri for Agioi Anargyroi (1 July) and an early-August village feast.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#nenita-clean-monday-panigiri-nenita
